---
// Write skew in the on-call doctors example: two transactions read the same snapshot,
// verify count >= 2, and update disjoint rows so write locks never collide.
// Plain inline SVG using site tokens; polygon arrowheads (no duplicate ids).

const W = 900;
const H = 414;

function arrowRight(x1: number, x2: number, y: number) {
  return { line: `M${x1},${y} L${x2 - 7},${y}`, head: `${x2 - 8},${y - 4.5} ${x2 - 8},${y + 4.5} ${x2},${y}` };
}

const cols = [
  { x: 138, w: 154 },
  { x: 316, w: 200 },
  { x: 540, w: 192 },
  { x: 756, w: 124 },
];

const lane1Y = 104;
const lane2Y = 216;
const boxH = 54;

const arrows1 = cols.slice(1).map((c, i) => arrowRight(cols[i].x + cols[i].w + 2, c.x - 2, lane1Y + boxH / 2));
const arrows2 = cols.slice(1).map((c, i) => arrowRight(cols[i].x + cols[i].w + 2, c.x - 2, lane2Y + boxH / 2));
---
<figure class="txw">
  <div class="txw-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Write skew timeline for two on-call doctors under snapshot isolation. Both Tx 1 for Dr. Lan and Tx 2 for Dr. Minh read a snapshot showing 2 doctors on call, then each updates a different row to off call. Because their write sets do not overlap, both transactions commit and leave 0 doctors on call.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="txw-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Write skew: disjoint writes break a shared rule</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Write skew: sửa hai dòng khác nhau vẫn phá quy tắc chung</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="48" class="txw-sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Rule: shift #42 must keep at least 1 doctor on call. Both doctors click "go off call" at the same instant.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Quy tắc: ca #42 phải còn ít nhất 1 bác sĩ trực. Cả hai bác sĩ bấm xin nghỉ gần như cùng một lúc.</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Time markers */}
    <text x={cols[0].x} y="82" class="txw-time">
      <tspan data-lang-en>t0 · start snapshot</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>t0 · mở snapshot</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[1].x} y="82" class="txw-time">
      <tspan data-lang-en>t1 · check premise</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>t1 · kiểm tra điều kiện</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[2].x} y="82" class="txw-time">
      <tspan data-lang-en>t2 · disjoint writes</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>t2 · ghi hai dòng riêng</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[3].x} y="82" class="txw-time">
      <tspan data-lang-en>t3 · commit</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>t3 · commit</tspan>
    </text>
    <line x1="20" x2={W - 20} y1="91" y2="91" class="txw-rule" />

    {/* Lane 1: Tx 1 */}
    <text x="20" y={lane1Y + 24} class="txw-in-b">Tx 1</text>
    <text x="20" y={lane1Y + 43} class="txw-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Dr. Lan</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>BS Lan</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x={cols[0].x} y={lane1Y} width={cols[0].w} height={boxH} rx="4" class="txw-box" />
    <text x={cols[0].x + 12} y={lane1Y + 22} class="txw-in">BEGIN</text>
    <text x={cols[0].x + 12} y={lane1Y + 41} class="txw-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Lan=on, Minh=on</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Lan=trực, Minh=trực</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x={cols[1].x} y={lane1Y} width={cols[1].w} height={boxH} rx="4" class="txw-box" />
    <text x={cols[1].x + 12} y={lane1Y + 22} class="txw-in">SELECT COUNT(*) → 2</text>
    <text x={cols[1].x + 12} y={lane1Y + 41} class="txw-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>premise holds (≥ 2)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>đủ điều kiện (≥ 2)</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x={cols[2].x} y={lane1Y} width={cols[2].w} height={boxH} rx="4" class="txw-box" />
    <text x={cols[2].x + 12} y={lane1Y + 22} class="txw-in">UPDATE Lan = off</text>
    <text x={cols[2].x + 12} y={lane1Y + 41} class="txw-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>write-locks row Lan</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>chỉ khoá dòng Lan</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x={cols[3].x} y={lane1Y} width={cols[3].w} height={boxH} rx="4" class="txw-box" />
    <text x={cols[3].x + cols[3].w / 2} y={lane1Y + 32} text-anchor="middle" class="txw-in-b">COMMIT ok</text>

    {arrows1.map((a) => (
      <g><path d={a.line} class="txw-arrow" /><polygon points={a.head} class="txw-head" /></g>
    ))}

    {/* Middle disjoint-row note */}
    <text x={cols[2].x + cols[2].w / 2} y="191" text-anchor="middle" class="txw-mid">
      <tspan data-lang-en>disjoint rows → write locks never collide</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>khác dòng → lock ghi không hề chạm nhau</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Lane 2: Tx 2 */}
    <text x="20" y={lane2Y + 24} class="txw-in-b">Tx 2</text>
    <text x="20" y={lane2Y + 43} class="txw-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Dr. Minh</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>BS Minh</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x={cols[0].x} y={lane2Y} width={cols[0].w} height={boxH} rx="4" class="txw-box" />
    <text x={cols[0].x + 12} y={lane2Y + 22} class="txw-in">BEGIN</text>
    <text x={cols[0].x + 12} y={lane2Y + 41} class="txw-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Lan=on, Minh=on</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Lan=trực, Minh=trực</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x={cols[1].x} y={lane2Y} width={cols[1].w} height={boxH} rx="4" class="txw-box" />
    <text x={cols[1].x + 12} y={lane2Y + 22} class="txw-in">SELECT COUNT(*) → 2</text>
    <text x={cols[1].x + 12} y={lane2Y + 41} class="txw-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>snapshot still sees Lan=on</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>snapshot vẫn thấy Lan=trực</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x={cols[2].x} y={lane2Y} width={cols[2].w} height={boxH} rx="4" class="txw-box" />
    <text x={cols[2].x + 12} y={lane2Y + 22} class="txw-in">UPDATE Minh = off</text>
    <text x={cols[2].x + 12} y={lane2Y + 41} class="txw-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>write-locks row Minh</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>chỉ khoá dòng Minh</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x={cols[3].x} y={lane2Y} width={cols[3].w} height={boxH} rx="4" class="txw-box is-bad" />
    <text x={cols[3].x + cols[3].w / 2} y={lane2Y + 24} text-anchor="middle" class="txw-in-b is-bad">COMMIT ok</text>
    <text x={cols[3].x + cols[3].w / 2} y={lane2Y + 42} text-anchor="middle" class="txw-note is-bad">
      <tspan data-lang-en>0 left on call</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>còn 0 người trực</tspan>
    </text>

    {arrows2.map((a) => (
      <g><path d={a.line} class="txw-arrow" /><polygon points={a.head} class="txw-head" /></g>
    ))}

    {/* Bottom outcome comparison */}
    <rect x="20" y="308" width="420" height="82" rx="4" class="txw-box is-bad" />
    <text x="36" y="334" class="txw-in-b is-bad">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Snapshot Isolation allows both commits</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Snapshot Isolation cho phép cả hai commit</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="356" class="txw-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Each tx wrote a different row, so first-committer-wins passes.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi tx sửa một dòng riêng, nên luật ghi đè không bắt được.</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="376" class="txw-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Yet both acted on a premise (count = 2) that went stale.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Nhưng cả hai đều dựa trên tiền đề (còn 2) đã hết hiệu lực.</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="460" y="308" width="420" height="82" rx="4" class="txw-box" />
    <text x="476" y="334" class="txw-in-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>How databases stop write skew</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Cách database chặn write skew</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="476" y="356" class="txw-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Existing rows: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE locks both rows early.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Đã có dòng: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE khoá cả hai dòng từ đầu.</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="476" y="376" class="txw-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Zero rows yet (phantoms): needs 2PL range locks or SSI.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Chưa có dòng (phantom): cần range lock của 2PL hoặc SSI.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Write skew is a generalization of lost updates across multiple objects. Under snapshot isolation (including PostgreSQL's REPEATABLE READ and Oracle's "SERIALIZABLE"), neither transaction touches the same row, so both commit and violate the hospital's invariant.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Write skew là dạng tổng quát của lost update trên nhiều bản ghi. Ở mức snapshot isolation (gồm cả REPEATABLE READ của PostgreSQL và "SERIALIZABLE" của Oracle), hai giao dịch không đụng cùng dòng nên đều commit được, làm gãy quy tắc bất biến của bệnh viện.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .txw {
    margin: 2em 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .txw-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .txw svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 640px;
    height: auto;
  }
  .txw text {
    font-size: 14px;
    fill: var(--text-body);
  }
  .txw .txw-h {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .txw .txw-sub {
    font-size: 13px;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .txw .txw-time {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .txw-rule {
    stroke: var(--border);
  }
  .txw-box {
    fill: var(--bg-alt);
    stroke: var(--border);
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }
  .txw-box.is-bad {
    fill: var(--red-tint-bg);
    stroke: var(--red);
    stroke-width: 1.6;
  }
  .txw .txw-in {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .txw .txw-in-b {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .txw .txw-in-b.is-bad {
    fill: var(--red);
  }
  .txw .txw-note {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .txw .txw-note.is-bad {
    fill: var(--red);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .txw .txw-mid {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--red);
  }
  .txw-arrow {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--text-muted);
    stroke-width: 1.4;
  }
  .txw-head {
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .txw figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
